    "note": "Version read: Amended 2022-08-11 (Senate 2022-08-22 and final Assembly 2022-08-30 votes on it). Assembly's first vote (2022-05-25) was on the Introduced text. Struck from all three sections (18150, 18170, 18190): '(G) A classmate of the subject of the petition.' and 'A dating partner of' (replaced by 'An individual who has a dating relationship with'); the co-parent petitioner now needs one year of substantial and regular interactions. Operative September 1, 2020 provisions as printed."
